%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    %h2.testingtestingtodo
      Why Jenkins
    .cards
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"git-pull-request-outline"}
        %h5
          Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery
        %p
          As an extensible automation server, Jenkins can be used as a simple
          CI server or turned into the continuous delivery hub for any project.
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"download-outline"}
        %h5
          Easy installation
        %p
          Jenkins is a self-contained Java-based program, ready to run
          out-of-the-box, with packages for Windows, Linux, macOS and other
          Unix-like operating systems.
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"options-outline"}
        %h5
          Easy configuration
        %p
          Jenkins can be easily set up and configured via its web interface,
          which includes on-the-fly error checks and built-in help.
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"apps-outline"}
        %h5
          Plugins
        %p
          With hundreds of plugins in the Update Center, Jenkins integrates
          with practically every tool in the continuous integration and
          continuous delivery toolchain.
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"extension-puzzle-outline"}
        %h5
          Extensible
        %p
          Jenkins can be extended via its plugin architecture, providing
          nearly infinite possibilities for what Jenkins can do.
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"git-network-outline"}
        %h5
          Distributed
        %p
          Jenkins can easily distribute work across multiple machines,
          helping drive builds, tests and deployments across multiple
          platforms faster.

%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    %h2
      Stories
    .stories
      .card
        %ion-icon{:name=>"git-pull-request-outline"}
        %h5
          Jenkins on Jenkins
        %p
          Read about how Jenkins uses Jenkins to build Jenkins.
      %div{:style => "display: grid; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem"}
        .card
          %ion-icon{:name=>"git-pull-request-outline"}
          %h5
            something
          %p
            As an extensible automation server, Jenkins can be used as a simple
            CI server or turned into the continuous delivery hub for any project.
        .card
          %ion-icon{:name=>"git-pull-request-outline"}
          %h5
            something
          %p
            As an extensible automation server, Jenkins can be used as a simple
            CI server or turned into the continuous delivery hub for any project.

%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    %h2
      Plugins
    %p{:class => 'paulsimon'}
      Make Jenkins your own with thousands of plugins available to install and customize.
    .betty
      %a.app-button.app-button--primary{:href => "https://plugins.jenkins.io"}
        View plugins
        %ion-icon{:name => "chevron-forward-outline"}

%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    = partial('blogs.html.haml')

%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    %h2
      There's a Jenkins for you
    %p{:class => 'paulsimon'}
      Meet your Jenkins match - a gallery of playful, community-made Jenkins variations, each with its own personality and style.
    .betty
      %a.app-button.app-button--primary{:href => "artwork"}
        Find your Jenkins
        %ion-icon{:name => "chevron-forward-outline"}
    %div.artworkpop
      - site.logo.to_a.shuffle.select { |_, logo| logo[:vector] || logo["vector"] }.first(5).each do |key, logo|
        %img.logo-thumb{:src => expand_link("images/#{logo['vector']}"), :alt => logo['name'], :loading => "lazy", :style => "rotate: 10deg"}

%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    %h2
      Get involved
    %p{:class => 'paulsimon'}
      Jenkins wouldn't be Jenkins without its thousands of contributors. Every contribution matters: code, documentation, localization, blog posts, artwork, meetups, and more.
    .betty
      %a.app-button.app-button--primary{:href => "participate"}
        Get involved
        %ion-icon{:name => "chevron-forward-outline"}

%div.app-home-landing2
  .app-container
    %h2
      With thanks to
    %p{:class => 'paulsimon'}
      We thank the following organizations for their major commitments to
      support the Jenkins project.

    %ul.supporters
      - supporters.select{|sponsor| sponsor[:logo]}.each do |sponsor|
        %li
          %a{:href => sponsor[:url]}
            = File.read("content/images/sponsors/#{sponsor[:logo]}")

    %ul.supporters
      - supporters.reject{|supporter| supporter[:logo]}.each do |supporter|
        %li
          %a{:href => supporter[:url]}= supporter[:name]

  = partial('thank-you-note.html.haml')
